<h1>One HTTP client for ChatGPT sign-in</h1>
<p>With {{ release.tag }}, <code>dekopon-gatewayd auth chatgpt</code> and ChatGPT token refresh run on the async HTTP client. The blocking <code>ureq</code> client is gone from the build.</p>
